WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Place a bolster a few inches from a wall or simply on the mat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sit on the bolster, then swing the legs up.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rest the arms open and soften the face.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Stay for several quiet minutes.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Bend the knees and roll to the side to exit.
